        "en": "Inside the lighthouse, the spiral stair opened one step at a time and quickly locked again."
      },
      "endingTitle": {
        "ko": "한 턴 더 붙잡은 문",
        "en": "The Door Held One Turn Longer"
      },
      "ending": {
        "ko": "자물쇠들은 누군가를 가두려던 게 아니었어. 꺼져 가는 불씨가 새어 나가지 않게 붙잡고 있었어.",
        "en": "The locks were never meant to trap anyone. They were holding in a fading ember so it would not escape."
      }
    },
